Package: io.github.omnircm.ios
Name: OmniRCM
Version: 1.1.1
Icon: https://omnircm.nintendohomebrew.com/repo/icon.png
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Nintendo Switch RCM payload injector with full diagnostics.
 Supports unpatched V1, patched V1, and V2/Mariko detection.
 Fetches payloads from GitHub (fusee, hekate, TegraExplorer).
Maintainer: DefenderOfHyrule <https://github.com/DefenderOfHyrule>
Author: DefenderOfHyrule
Section: Utilities
Depends: firmware (>= 9.0)
Tag: compatible_min_ios :: 9.0